<title>FRANCE: CNCA sets 12 pct R.O.E. target for Banque Indosuez.</title>
<headline>CNCA sets 12 pct R.O.E. target for Banque Indosuez.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>France's Credit Agricole will seek a return on equity of nine percent from Banque Indosuez by 1998 and then aim for 12 percent, Caisse Nationale du Credit Agricole Chief Executive Lucien Douroux said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>&quot;We're keeping this objective, nine percent by 1998,&quot; he told reporters. &quot;Thereafter we will look for 12 percent.&quot;</p>
<p>Credit Agricole, the country's largest retail bank, bought 51 percent of Banque Indosuez from holding group Suez in July to expand into international investment banking.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
